203
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:43,680
She may look like a stealth fighter plane or something out of Star Wars,

204
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:46,380
but she is a United States naval vessel.

205
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:51,520
She is 162 feet long and cruises at 13 knots.

206
00:17:51,521 --> 00:17:55,020
But this remarkable prototype is like no other in the Navy.

207
00:17:57,420 --> 00:17:59,560
Her deck is empty of sailors.

208
00:18:00,820 --> 00:18:06,040
Her bridge lacks a steering wheel, and she sails with no superstructure or rudders.

209
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:11,040
Her name is Sea Shadow, and she is turning stealth theory into reality.

210
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:19,440
She is not often photographed up close, but we are getting a rare look at one of the first of a new generation of stealthy ships.

211
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:27,820
Her eerie shape and remarkable propulsion and steering systems break the mold on how Navy warships of the future will look and operate.

212
00:18:27,821 --> 00:18:31,780
Sea Shadow certainly is different than any other Navy vessel.

213
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:34,420
There are a couple of reasons that drive that.

214
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:38,740
The reason for sloping the sides is to reflect the radar energy away.

215
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:41,740
It's similar to taking a flashlight and shining it in a mirror.

216
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:46,020
If you tilt the mirror back and shine a light at it, then it goes off in another direction.

217
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:56,120
Sea Shadow has been used as a research platform to test stealth hull designs

218
00:18:56,121 --> 00:18:59,860
for reducing a ship's dangerous vulnerability to radar detection.

219
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:08,520
Her unique hull has offered up data that will be incorporated in stealth warships to come.

220
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:12,640
Her radically angled sides shed radar waves like water.

221
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:17,840
And in spite of her futuristic shape, Sea Shadow is extremely seaworthy.

222
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:23,500
The reason the Sea Shadow is very stable is because of its SWATH hull form.

